  "description": "A fast, code-first ORM for SQLite. Entity Framework-style productivity without a DbContext: define your entities, call SuperNova once at startup, and the database creates and migrates itself. Supports navigation properties, fluent relationships, joins, transactions, raw SQL, multi-database setups, and soft delete.",
