  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BlackHole.Lite 8.0.0 — first official release.\n\n- Stable public API with full XML documentation.\n- Automatic database creation and schema migration.\n- Fluent relationships: HasOne / WithOne / WithMany / HasForeignKey / OnDelete.\n- Eager loading with Include and ThenInclude.\n- Inner / Left / Right / Outer joins with DTO projections.\n- Stored views (IBHInitialViews) and seed data (IBHInitialData).\n- Transactions via BHTransaction.\n- Raw SQL escape hatch via BHConnection.\n- Multi-database support routed by namespace.\n- Soft delete via [UseActivator].\n- Supported types: int, uint, short, ushort, long, ulong, byte, bool, float, double, decimal, string, Guid, DateTime, DateTimeOffset, and nullable variants.",
